<title>GERMANY: Heidelberger Zement sees 96 profit up.</title>
<headline>Heidelberger Zement sees 96 profit up.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>German cement manufacturer Heidelberger Zement AG said on Wednesday it expected its group net profit for 1996 to be above the 1995 level of 468.6 million marks.</p>
<p>Group sales in 1996 were up five percent at about 6.4 billion marks, the company announced at the &quot;Bau 97&quot; construction industry trade fair in Munich. Sales in 1995 totalled 6.0 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
